1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,410
(Raj:)I'm a walking, brown yelp.com.

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,870
(Sheldon:)Structure, constant structure.
One atom.

3
00:00:08,038 --> 00:00:10,748
(Howard:)Boy, he's really gone, isn't he?

4
00:00:10,916 --> 00:00:14,166
(Leonard:)Yeah. This morning he used
a stick of butter as deodorant.

5
00:00:15,128 --> 00:00:18,468
(Howard:)I thought I smelled popcorn.

6
00:00:20,759 --> 00:00:22,799
(Sheldon:)The same as fermions.
Travels on a pathway.

7
00:00:22,969 --> 00:00:24,389
Hexagonal. Always hexagonal.

8
00:00:24,554 --> 00:00:28,764
(Leonard:)I haven't seen him this stuck since he
tried to figure out the third Matrix movie.

9
00:00:30,185 --> 00:00:31,315
[SHELDON GASPS]

10
00:00:31,478 --> 00:00:33,728
(Raj(as Sheldon reaches out and grabs from his plate):)Hey. Those are my lima beans.

11
00:00:33,897 --> 00:00:36,527
(Sheldon:)Not lima beans. Carbon atoms.

12
00:00:36,691 --> 00:00:40,651
(Raj:)But if I don't eat my lima beans,
I can't have my cookie.

13
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,200
(Leonard:)Here. You want my peas?

14
00:00:42,364 --> 00:00:44,864
Peas. Perfect. They can be electrons.

15
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:46,113
You want my corn?

16
00:00:46,284 --> 00:00:48,324
(Sheldon:)Don't be ridiculous.

17
00:00:49,537 --> 00:00:51,167
(Sheldon:)What would I do with corn?

18
00:00:52,499 --> 00:00:55,039
(Howard:)Roller skating.
Shall we grab a bite to eat first?

19
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:57,250
(Howard:)Good. P.F. Chang's?
My mom has coupons.

